  "riskDetail.desc.cyber": "Internet-facing systems in the {entity} entity are running software past vendor end-of-support, leaving known CVEs unremediated. Successful exploitation could permit unauthorised access to customer-facing services and lateral movement into internal networks holding regulated data.",
  "riskDetail.desc.privacy": "Personal data is transferred from the {entity} entity to processors in other jurisdictions without a fully executed transfer mechanism in every case, creating exposure to data-protection enforcement and material customer-trust impact.",
  "riskDetail.desc.thirdParty": "A material share of production workloads in the {entity} entity depends on a single external provider. Provider outage, insolvency, or security failure would directly disrupt customer service with limited short-term substitutability.",
  "riskDetail.desc.continuity": "The disaster-recovery failover procedure for core services in the {entity} entity has not been exercised this fiscal year, so recovery-time and recovery-point objectives are unverified against a real regional-outage scenario.",
  "riskDetail.desc.operational": "Weaknesses in the joiner-mover-leaver process in the {entity} entity allow access to persist beyond role changes and exits, increasing the window for misuse of standing access.",
  "riskDetail.desc.regulatory": "Monitoring and reporting obligations applicable to the {entity} entity are not fully evidenced, creating exposure to regulatory findings and remediation orders.",
